### Low-risk approval
# Local development credentials are defined in application.yml. Replace them in production.
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-merchant-key
Idempotency-Key: checkout-2026-0001

{"transactionId":"tx-10001","accountId":"acct-42","deviceId":"device-trusted-42","ipAddress":"203.0.113.10","amount":1499.00,"currency":"INR","billingCountry":"IN","ipCountry":"IN","cardPresent":false,"accountAgeDays":720}

### High-risk decline: country mismatch + high value + CNP + new account
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-merchant-key
Idempotency-Key: checkout-2026-0002

{"transactionId":"tx-10002","accountId":"acct-new","deviceId":"device-new","ipAddress":"198.51.100.9","amount":2500.00,"currency":"USD","billingCountry":"US","ipCountry":"RU","cardPresent":false,"accountAgeDays":1}

### Create immutable rule-set draft
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/rule-sets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-analyst-key

{"highValueThreshold":2500,"newAccountDays":14,"accountVelocityLimit":5,"ipVelocityLimit":12,"deviceVelocityLimit":4,"reviewThreshold":35,"declineThreshold":70}

### Activate draft (replace id with create response)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/rule-sets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/activation
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-analyst-key

### List open manual-review cases
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/reviews
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-analyst-key

### Claim a review for five minutes
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/reviews/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000199/claim
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-Analyst-Id: analyst-7
X-API-Key: demo-analyst-key

{"leaseSeconds":300}

### Resolve a claimed review
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/reviews/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000199/resolution
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-Analyst-Id: analyst-7
X-API-Key: demo-analyst-key

{"resolution":"DECLINE","note":"Account takeover confirmed from linked activity"}

### Inspect the candidate model's shadow evaluation
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/decisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000299/shadow-evaluation
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-merchant-key

### Ingest a verified chargeback label
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-merchant-key
Idempotency-Key: chargeback-cb-8472

{"decisionId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000299","label":"CONFIRMED_FRAUD","source":"CHARGEBACK","externalReference":"cb-8472","observedAt":"2026-10-09T10:00:00Z"}

### Retrieve a decision's feedback timeline
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/feedback/decisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000299
X-Tenant-Id: merchant-demo
X-API-Key: demo-merchant-key
